                            B.Tech. in Electrical Engineering program offers a strong foundation in the principles of electricity and electronics while integrating modern technologies that are shaping the future. The curriculum covers core subjects such as power systems, control systems, electrical machines, and signal processing, alongside emerging areas like renewable energy.
                        </p>
